WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.473
(upbeat music)

00:00:00.473 --> 00:00:00.946
Hi everyone!

00:00:00.946 --> 00:00:07.569
As new sellers, we would love to check our sales all the time, right?

00:00:07.569 --> 00:00:14.665
It's great if it's always going upward, but what if we see a sales dip?

00:00:14.665 --> 00:00:23.654
Today I'm going to talk about a checklist that you can go through quickly to self-diagnose any sales

00:00:23.654 --> 00:00:24.600
downward trend.

00:00:24.660 --> 00:00:30.384
First, I would go to the Account Health page to see if there is any policy warning, violation, or

00:00:30.384 --> 00:00:34.300
compliance issues that you have to deal with to get your listing reactivated.

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:34.865
The dashboard

00:00:34.865 --> 00:00:39.100
is very self-explanatory and you should be able to spot the issues right away.

00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:39.418
Second

00:00:39.418 --> 00:00:42.915
place I will see is pricing health under pricing on Amazon.

00:00:42.915 --> 00:00:45.141
It will tell you if there's any

00:00:45.141 --> 00:00:48.320
of your ASINs loses buy box due to pricing issues.

00:00:48.320 --> 00:00:50.908
And third place I will look at would

00:00:50.908 --> 00:00:53.820
be the inactive listing tab under manage all inventory.

00:00:53.820 --> 00:00:56.555
It will show you all the listings

00:00:56.555 --> 00:01:02.417
that are not active due to common reason out of stock or softer listing suppression

00:01:02.417 --> 00:01:08.278
issues such as any problems with your title, any problems with your images that cause

00:01:08.278 --> 00:01:09.060
listing suppressions.

00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:13.146
The fourth place, what if your PPC is not running due to payment

00:01:13.146 --> 00:01:13.460
failure?

00:01:13.460 --> 00:01:15.383
That's the fourth place I will look.

00:01:15.383 --> 00:01:17.857
If there is any payment issue with your PPC,

00:01:17.857 --> 00:01:23.352
it will show up on top of the PPC console page as a red banner and tell you that your

00:01:23.352 --> 00:01:26.100
PPC is currently paused because the payment doesn't go through.

00:01:26.100 --> 00:01:27.934
Now the second part would

00:01:27.934 --> 00:01:33.438
be softer reasons why you see a sudden sales dip, including your active running coupon

00:01:33.438 --> 00:01:36.740
or your active running Lightning Deal or best deal.

00:01:36.740 --> 00:01:38.496
Are there any errors with them?

00:01:38.496 --> 00:01:39.081
If there

00:01:39.081 --> 00:01:44.056
is any error, you are going to see a need attention badge underneath that particular coupon or

00:01:44.056 --> 00:01:47.860
that particular deal so that you can go in quickly and fix it.

00:01:47.860 --> 00:01:49.133
Usually the common reason

00:01:49.133 --> 00:01:51.996
for deal or coupon suppression is also pricing issues.

00:01:51.996 --> 00:01:54.224
And then the promotions that are important

00:01:54.224 --> 00:01:59.304
to you, I would suggest that you go and check in and see if those promotions are expired

00:01:59.304 --> 00:02:03.749
without you knowing it or they're running out of budget already, which is also a reason

00:02:03.749 --> 00:02:04.860
why they're not running.

00:02:04.860 --> 00:02:08.527
The last thing I would check is the best seller rank.

00:02:08.527 --> 00:02:08.860
It's

00:02:08.860 --> 00:02:10.193
on top of Amazon.

00:02:10.193 --> 00:02:10.860
com page.

00:02:10.860 --> 00:02:14.860
You can check for your niche is your ASIN ranking well relative

00:02:14.860 --> 00:02:15.860
to other competitors.

00:02:15.860 --> 00:02:19.922
I actually check that daily to make sure my ASIN is well positioned

00:02:19.922 --> 00:02:20.860
within my niche.

00:02:20.860 --> 00:02:24.245
So those are all the checklists that we should quickly look.

00:02:24.245 --> 00:02:24.860
Happy selling!
